Track 3: The Cathode Sigh
- Story & Context: Years after the facility was permanently sealed, a scavenger named Lena broke into the ruins to find the legendary "Zero-Point" patch that supposedly ended the final party. She found a single, scorched Hohner Clavinet sitting in the center of the accelerator ring, still warm to the touch. When she pressed a key, the entire tunnel groaned, releasing a massive wave of sound that shook the mountains above. "Everything ends in a jagged hum."
